     H            D
     ***
     FBIERE   UF  E           K        DISK
     FECRANRPGCF  E                    WORKSTN
     *** Renomage zone
     IBEERF
     I              TXTVAPR                         TXTVA
     I              PRIDPR                          NUMBER
     I              PRNOPR                          NOM
      *
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           NUMBER
     C           NUMBER    CHAINBEERF                99
     C   99                MOVEL'BIERE'   MSG    14
     C   99                MOVE 'INCONNUE'MSG
     C   99                DSPLY          MSG
     C   99                GOTO FIN
     C           RETRY     TAG
     C                     EXFMTFMTPOP
     C           VALID     IFNE 'OUI'
     C           VALID     ANDNE'NON'
     C                     SETON                         96
     C                     GOTO RETRY
     C                     ENDIF
     C           VALID     IFEQ 'OUI'
     C                     DELETBEERF
     C                     ENDIF
     C           FIN       TAG
     C                     SETON                         LR
